Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:11.11,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs15\frx6\fry338\frz4.246\pos(353,29)\3c&HC6C5C1&\c&H62615A&}Somei \NFamily Grave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:09.62,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wait, did Dad actually like sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.10,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Nah, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:14.28,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,He was even more of a chicken than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:17.60,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,I think he didn't wanna drink \N'cuz he was scared of hangovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:22.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be older than \Nhe was before long...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:26.42,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Yep. Plus, Kyosuke was \N19 when he got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:29.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That's only a year away for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:31.62,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I can't even picture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.00,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Wait a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:38.56,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Are you wearin' makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wh-What if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:43.30,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,You don't even look that different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:45.70,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,If you're gonna do it, you \Noughta really get painted up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:48.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hell no! What are you even talkin' about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:22.05,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That was a real close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.05,0:02:25.13,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Good thing the makeup job managed to \Nfool him about how banged up I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:29.75,sign_generic,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs18\3c&HCAD9D1&\c&H5D655D&\fade(200,1)}A Pet that Becomes Unruly as It Grows
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:29.74,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Your face will heal soon enough, \Nbut what happened to the tooth you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:33.57,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, I saw a dentist this morning, \Nand they said they should be able to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:34.75,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:37.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'll see about finding \Na dentist in Tokyo too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.27,0:02:39.02,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, let me carry that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:40.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:43.60,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,You two seem pretty happy \Nabout keeping this quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:47.53,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,but if you get carried away,\N Renji-san will see right through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.53,0:02:49.23,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,You'll want to keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:51.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:55.52,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Granted, someone seems angrier than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:59.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Oh, Shoma? I already apologized to him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.77,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You reckon he's still mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:06.03,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I ain't mad. And you oughta \Nstop runnin' your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:08.84,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,You finally open your mouth \Nand it's to pick a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.05,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,You delinquents are {\i1}so{\i0} much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:14.65,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,That's real rich, comin' from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:18.57,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,A monkey in heat behaves better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:19.94,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:23.38,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,I'm really curious how a ****boy such \Nas yourself can be such a hypocrite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:26.34,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Osakan men are just so awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:28.77,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it you worn \Nout meat****** of a ****.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:30.61,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Take your loose ass back to Kyoto already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:33.46,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't mind them. They always do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:34.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:39.43,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Ever since the first time Tsubaki \Ncame over and met Shoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.43,0:03:42.19,flashback,Shoma,0,0,0,,What're you? Some kinda exhibitionist?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:45.57,flashback,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,If you're looking, then have \Nthe decency to get hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.90,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You had a loose eyelash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:04.34,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Oh my, how immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.41,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:09.59,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Shoma-kun, too, but mostly you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.16,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm Miyama Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.36,Default,Yakuza,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:25.27,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Gotta say, kid... you seriously \Nlook exactly like Gaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:27.03,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,It's kinda creepin' me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:30.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't be like that. It's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:32.23,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Think about it. To me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:36.27,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,it feels like one of my old pals is \Ntrying to seduce my granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:37.36,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Tsubaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:38.97,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,It certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.37,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Don't agree with him every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.66,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,So, you love Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:45.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:46.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:51.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm confident I love Yoshino more \Nthan anyone in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:57.15,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord1\frz3.087\3c&HB8B8B8&\c&H1A00A7&\pos(258,131)}What the hell's \Nthis little shit sayin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:56.02,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dude's got more guts than a pod of whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:05:00.98,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This is makin' me thirsty. \NHow about you? Want a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:03.91,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Nah, nah. He probably don't drink, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.10,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wait, who doesn't drink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:07.19,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:08.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:11.67,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Kid's gramps is a real teetotaler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.42,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,His poison is sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.89,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Gramps...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:17.43,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean Boss Miyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.84,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,You two sound really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.83,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,That reminds me of the time I \Nborrowed the first car he bought,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:25.68,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,without tellin' him, and crashed \Nit right into a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.68,sign_generic,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fade(200,1)\an9\c&H2D3096&\3c&H8AD1D6&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.67,flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:29.57,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:31.46,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,I'm tellin' you, it was a total accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:35.39,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,So what I did was take the side \Nmirror off it and stuck it to a bike
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:37.65,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,that was left by a pachinko \Njoint and returned that to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.65,0:05:38.94,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're outta your damn mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.04,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.81,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Same kinda reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:48.54,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Then, once he got done laughin' his \Nhead off, he beat the shit outta me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:46.03,sign_generic,SFX Signs,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\bord1\fade(300,200)\c&HAB7538&\3c&HD9D9D9&\pos(409.245,2.453)}Hahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.95,sign_generic,SFX Signs,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\bord1\fade(300,2)\c&H2C10BA&\3c&HD9D9D9&\pos(452.264,41.321)}Auuuugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.95,sign_generic,SFX Signs,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\bord1\fade(300,2)\c&H801B2A&\3c&HD9D9D9&\frz17.07\pos(291.132,165.471)}Thud
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.95,sign_generic,SFX Signs,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\bord1\fade(300,2)\c&H801B2A&\3c&HD9D9D9&\pos(413.396,156.037)}Smack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:54.03,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,I dunno what it is, but guy's always been \Nreal great at fightin' and gamblin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:56.44,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Hell, I can't even beat him \Nat rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dude, did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:02.40,Default,Yakuza,0,0,0,,Welcome, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:06.02,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:08.17,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Sorry about being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:09.98,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Aw, forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:13.01,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Yoshino, I got some \Nbusiness to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:15.85,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Tell the boys to wrap it \Nup once it gets late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.29,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Don't wanna bother the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:17.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.23,sign_generic,Phone sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&HB3D1DE&\c&H183341&}Do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:28.03,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Come by the basement, later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:31.87,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.33,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:40.67,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry to drag you down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:42.41,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, it's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:46.16,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Pretty sweet setup, right?\N Air conditioned and soundproofed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:49.16,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Dunno if it's improved \Nmy game at all, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:53.67,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Don't pay the blood no mind. \NShoma was down here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:57.93,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Care to explain that scar by your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:00.93,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I got into a bit of a fight with Shoma-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:02.66,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Yeah? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:05.24,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Nothing major, but we got into \Nan argument about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:08.09,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Shoma said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:09.45,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Wouldn't say anything else, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:13.19,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,What were you up to in \Nthe city, the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:16.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Someone had a personal vendetta with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.56,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,We managed to talk it out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:20.62,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,And it had to happen in Osaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:21.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:26.09,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Tell me about this personal vendetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:30.34,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Some associates of that girl from \NAkaza Enterprises were still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:34.36,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,That dumbass kid from the big talent \Nagency was involved too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:37.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He was a separate issue—one \Ninvolving an old girl of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:40.96,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,You got no shortage of trouble, do ya, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:45.10,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,And Yoshino sniffin' around, was that \Nbecause of this stuff you were gettin' up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.10,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:56.83,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,You think you're real clever, don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:59.55,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Took care of all the evidence in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:02.21,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,None of my guys were able to \Nfind anything that mattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:04.25,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,even on the surveillance footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:09.42,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,You're old hat at this, huh? \NOnly had tea, earlier, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:13.26,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,'Cuz you knew you were gonna be puking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:16.23,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Makes me wonder how Gaku raised you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:20.01,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,So, you insist this was some personal thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.01,0:08:21.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.78,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,And Yoshino wasn't involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.78,0:08:24.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:30.02,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Damn, kid. You really are just like Gaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:32.52,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Talk about an awkward pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:36.83,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Kyosuke dyin' put a lid \Non things for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:39.07,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,But I'm losin' my patience, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:46.11,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,I'll have to settle for you, though. \NLook after Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:49.12,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:53.13,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Did you tell Shoma-kun how you're \Ndating Kirishima-kun, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.28,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Considering how recently I saw you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:57.53,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,I didn't think the two of you \Nwould be going out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:01.14,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I mean, we're "going out," but only \Nbecause I lost at rock, paper, scissors...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:06.18,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And get this, I think he \N{\i1}knew{\i0} he was gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:07.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How cheap is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.95,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Still, that was the deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:13.44,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What does it even mean to go out, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.91,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Well, in my case, it means \Ndating, kissing, and sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:21.68,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Relax. Knowing Kirishima-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:24.43,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,he won't do anything you're \Nuncomfortable with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:27.72,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, you're right. \NHe wouldn't do stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:30.56,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Don't let him wrap you around \Nhis little finger, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:33.14,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,In baseball terms, Kirishima-kun is a pro,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:35.84,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,and you don't even know \Nhow to pick up a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.32,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:42.23,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,He seems like the type to gradually \Ntighten the noose over time, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:45.47,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,He's a bit like a door-to-door salesman \Nwho charms his way into your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:46.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,A salesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.35,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(150,150)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs12\3c&HF5F8F5&\c&H313432&\pos(590,131)}Do you \Nhave a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:51.24,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Once he's inside, it's all over, and you end up \Nsigning a contract just from listening to him talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.35,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(150,150)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs12\3c&HF5F8F5&\c&H313432&\pos(387,129)}It won't\N take long!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:49.61,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(150,150)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs12\3c&HF5F8F5&\c&H313432&\pos(253,165)}I just need your \Nsignature here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:50.86,sign_generic,,0,0,0,,{\fade(150,150)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs12\3c&HF5F8F5&\c&H313432&\pos(55,157)}I'll be there to \Nsupport you every \Nwaking moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:50.86,sign_generic,,0,0,0,,{\fade(150,150)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs12\3c&HF5F8F5&\c&H313432&\pos(184,112)}Now you'll have \Nsecurity for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.36,sign_generic,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fade(200,200)\bord1\pos(372,107)\c&H79462F&\3c&HBDBDBD&}Contract...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.31,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Contract...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,W-Well, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:56.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's got other girls, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:58.11,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Does he, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:09:59.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:03.89,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Yoshino-chan... Could you kiss \Nor have sex with a guy like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.83,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wh-What're you askin' for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:09.88,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,He seems to me like the kind of guy \Nwho's honest with his desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.99,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,And yet, he's pretty charming on top of that. \NThat's a pretty nasty combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:15.49,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,You take him in because he seems harmless,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:18.02,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,but once he's fully grown, \Nhe devours you whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:21.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I mighta made the right move \Ngoin' out with him, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:25.26,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's not like I did it for love's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:27.11,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:29.22,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Think about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:33.23,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,When I'm around, Shoma never gets violent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:35.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,no matter how pissed off he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:38.48,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The issue is Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Huh? Where is he, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:11:00.30,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Hey there. Can I get one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:21.44,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:23.70,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs23\c&H3A342F&\an7\3c&H7B786C&}Stop Smoking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:27.85,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,She tells you to quit, but gives \Nyou a lighter as a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:29.41,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How very Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,These taste like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:53.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm going out with Yoshino now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:57.69,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,We're dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:00.20,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You finally lose your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:04.52,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm officially taking over your old job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I can only imagine how much \Na relief that must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:08.07,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What job?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:13.01,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You have to have noticed. There's \Nalways someone near Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:17.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It used to be Boss Somei's \Nfavorite, Hotei Taketo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:20.93,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Once he moved up in the \Nbusiness, it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:25.60,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And with you not being in Osaka, it's now me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:27.50,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What're you gettin' at?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:32.16,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Have you ever wondered why Boss Somei \Nis so desperate to protect Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:32.84,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Naw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:35.73,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Wow, they really raised you \Nto be loyal, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:40.60,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It'd pay to be a little bit skeptical. \NYou might realize that they're using you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.31,0:12:43.62,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:45.86,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:50.07,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Neither me nor the guys in \Nthe family are being used.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:52.63,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,We do it because we wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:56.12,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You're the only one who thinks \Nthat, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:13:00.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But that's only because \Nyou've been indoctrinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:03.99,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Think about how you're not even willing to \Npunch a little shit like me around Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:07.31,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Just like a well-trained dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:10.13,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Won't do a thing without \Nyour master's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:12.76,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Nah, that's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:14.91,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You run your mouth thinkin' you're clever,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:18.14,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,but all it sounds like is the \Nbuzzin' of a fly by my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:20.90,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,And who tries to slug a fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:24.15,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Considerin' it's an insect, that's \Na waste of time and energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:26.28,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,If I'm an insect, you could always kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:29.65,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How about you try that? \NRight here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:34.65,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,She chose me. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:37.07,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That means I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:47.18,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You talkin' about winnin' and losin' \Nshows how off mark you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:50.94,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,She don't belong to me or you, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:54.30,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You do realize that's loser talk, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.26,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:14:00.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I have to return the GPS I planted \Non Kirishima since it's a rental,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:02.66,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,so I asked Shoma to drop it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:04.32,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If he's still got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:11.81,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aw hell, it's a local park. \NI got a bad feelin' about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.26,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Would you mind comin' with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:15.33,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:17.99,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,For a raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:41.48,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:46.14,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I borrowed these from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:49.07,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What now? You're free to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:54.72,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You steal from someone's house \Nand still talk big? Dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:07.02,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You've gotta realize there's no one in the \Ndamn world who'd love a prick like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:11.51,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I don't care as long as I have Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.68,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:20.35,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,...are you two doin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.44,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:24.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.45,0:15:29.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,D... Dying...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:34.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Yoshino? \NLet me see your ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.96,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Go find the buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:42.90,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Buttons?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Buttons from your shirts came loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:46.75,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Go find them already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:50.84,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,This what you wanted, Yoshino-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:51.99,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:57.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You found the buttons? Good. \NNow take your shirts off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:16:00.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Our shirts? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:04.10,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What do you mean, why? \NYou tore the damn buttons off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:10.37,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Good. Now swap shirts, \Nand sew the buttons back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:14.65,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Have you done this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:15.86,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:19.72,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Because Shoma was always \Ngettin' into fights...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:30.34,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs13\fnComic Sans MS\fade(200,1)\pos(402,60)\frz9.862\bord0\c&H3D338E&}Ding\N dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:30.34,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\b1\fnComic Sans MS\frz15.16\pos(309,41)\fade(200,1)}Excuse me! There was a fight with your \Nson and a button came loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:23.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If any uniforms got damaged, I made \Nhim go to the house of the other guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:25.31,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and had 'em fix each other's shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.74,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It made him stop fightin' so \Nhe wouldn't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:30.34,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Sounds like a lot of work...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,So start sewin'. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:38.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wow, ignoring me? \NThat takes some real guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:40.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You probably picked this fight, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:44.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Did Shoma do somethin' to you? \NHe didn't, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:50.57,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Okay then, Shoma, flick me in the forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Just do it. Hard as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:58.33,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dude, not that hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:00.61,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You said to do it, Yoshino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:05.98,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Kirishima, every time you ignore a question,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:08.12,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have Shoma hit me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.14,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.76,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,This is what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:13.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:16.90,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I wouldn't hit you, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:19.10,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I told him to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:20.88,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And I still wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:22.38,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I just don't get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:26.03,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How could he say your outfit \Nfrom two days ago was whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:28.68,flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Get a load of this outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.83,flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The top and dress together \Nwere only 3,000 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:32.98,flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What a find, right? Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:34.57,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yep, it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:35.03,flashbacktop,Shoma,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.56,0:17:38.89,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's obviously not whatever. \NIt's clearly cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Are you crazy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:42.43,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You don't get to say that \Nabout other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:44.13,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y'know what? Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:47.20,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,My point is, you started this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.39,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I guess I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.39,0:17:49.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What did you say to Shoma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:53.37,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I wanted to let him know we're going out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:56.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I thought that would make things clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.06,0:17:58.13,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm the one you chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:18:02.39,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Don't go around puttin' me on the \Nsame level as a scumbag like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:04.18,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Enough already! Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:11.14,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Kirishima, do you understand why \NI agreed to go out with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:12.71,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Because I won our bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:15.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That was just the method.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:19.77,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It was because I figured that sooner \Nor later, we would end up going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:20.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:23.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You keep gettin' on Shoma's case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:29.68,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I dunno if it's jealousy or whatever, \Nbut Shoma's obviously known me longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:34.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and we lived together, and there's \Nnothin' anybody can do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:40.67,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,So I figured, givin' you the spot of \N"boyfriend" would help even things out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:43.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,but now I find you here pickin' \Nfights in spite of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:48.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're my boyfriend {\i1}because{\i0} of Shoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:49.93,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Get that straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:53.60,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What? You got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:54.76,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:02.55,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Tsubaki, sorry, but could you \Nand Kirishima head back first?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.55,0:19:04.57,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I gotta talk to Shoma for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:05.82,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:10.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You shut up and go. We'll talk about \Nthis when we're back in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:16.25,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Yoshino-chan understands \Nbetter than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:21.62,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,You were trying to cover up how \NRenji-san beat you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:25.77,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,I can see why you'd want \Nto do something about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:27.52,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,considering he's her grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:29.39,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Was I too obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:34.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No. But you don't need to do that \Nsort of thing for Yoshino-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:36.53,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If anything, you're being too secretive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:39.11,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.11,0:19:42.14,Default,Tusbaki,0,0,0,,Well, you want her to \Ntake an interest in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:45.29,Default,Tusbaki,0,0,0,,yet you're hiding so much from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.65,0:19:48.80,Default,Tusbaki,0,0,0,,But that won't work.\N You're expecting too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:51.37,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to hide things from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:55.11,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Oh, you didn't even realize it? \NThat might be even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:59.79,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, \Ntry calling her to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:01.08,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,My room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.73,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Sure. After school one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.73,0:20:07.88,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,have your girlfriend over to your room, \Nstudy for exams together...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:10.00,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Maybe go over your yearbooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:12.56,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,How's that sound? \NA pretty typical high school date, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:15.83,Default,Tsubaki,0,0,0,,Other people's love lives are so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.75,0:20:19.44,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Ugh, even your undershirt's busted...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:24.87,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What're you so pissed for? \NIt ain't like I'm marryin' him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:28.61,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I'm fed up with how stupid this all is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.21,0:20:31.36,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Your whole approach is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.46,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You're just givin' him cause \Nto get fulla himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:34.96,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,S-Stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.95,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I almost killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:42.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Then I made the right call, stoppin' you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:47.12,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hey, you had a girlfriend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:49.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:53.02,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I think we broke up a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.19,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.19,0:20:56.24,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,How's any of this matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:21:00.72,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm just thinkin', dating somebody... \NHow's it even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.22,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,This is what I mean about bein' stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:07.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,So, if I actually liked Kirishima, \Nit'd be different?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.55,0:21:11.00,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Come on, don't clam up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:15.74,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Think about it. What kinda guy \Nwould even satisfy our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:19.00,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Who the hell am I supposed to marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:21.77,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Someone who can kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:26.90,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What? Do you like me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:30.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I mean, you keep makin' crazy demands...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:31.85,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:34.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Shut up! I was jokin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,There, it's fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:39.02,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Although, I gotta say...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:43.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Life with you wouldn't be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:48.74,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Get a decent-paying job, \Nand if we both saved up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:50.79,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,we'd probably be okay in old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:53.60,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:58.55,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Livin' with you would probably \Nbe pretty fun, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:01.57,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.57,0:22:04.43,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If we were gonna do that, \Nyou'd hafta quit smokin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:06.94,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Come on, answer me!
